<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">forage</ansi>

Forage is a ranger's skill. When a camp rest finishes in the wilds, the
company's best forager brings back food: 1 find, plus 1 more for every
2 levels (3 at level 4). On the Old Kings Road the finds are raw game
meat, wild thyme, and mushrooms. They go into the company's cargo
(<ansi fg="command">help cargo</ansi>); anything the company can't carry is left behind.

Raw meat and thyme are what a cook needs (<ansi fg="command">help cooking</ansi>). A rest spoiled
by raiders brings no forage.

See also: <ansi fg="command">help camp</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help specialists</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help cooking</ansi>.
